  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you you add a node which has multiple variants, like a Debug.Log. Then connect it to something and change its parameter type (from `Object` to `Object, Object`), the line will disconnect from it and will get stuck in a spot. \nReloading the graph seems to fix the issue\nIssue is only present in the Open Beta SDK released with the build 1080 (sdk 2021.04.16.12.12). It is good on current Live (sdk 2021.03.22.18.27)",
